comments.body:
@Haroenv 
>why don't you use useMenu for a single-select instead?

Yes, what I was trying to convey is that it's difficult to discern from the official documentation that useMenu should be used for single-select scenarios, while useRefinementList is intended for multi-select scenarios. I believe that the documentation for useMenu should include a link to useRefinementList, and vice versa, to make this distinction clearer.
